# P1 swept through every zone (off, 1/4 .. 1/64, back) while repeating, on clicks every step: the slice length
# follows the knob at each repeat, no new capture; P2 at 128 (-3 dB per repeat).
tempo 100
steps 48
tail 0.5
track fx2
input impulse 1 0.8
param p2 128
param pan 255
param level 255
gain 1
sweep p1 0 255 0 24
sweep p1 255 40 24 44
param p1 0 44
expect sound 0 48
expect peak_below 0
